  "description": "Only Kitty Cat Up is a cute but brutally addictive climbing adventure where you play as a tiny, fearless cat chasing one simple dream — reach the very top.\n\nJump from object to object, climb higher and higher, and test your patience, timing, and focus in a journey where every move matters. One small mistake can send you falling back down… but a true kitty never gives up.\n\nThis is a game about determination, precision, and that unstoppable “just one more try” feeling.  \nSoft paws, hard jumps, and a long way to the top.\n\nCute on the outside.  \nChallenging on the inside.",
